[0.0, "o", "Investigating REAL data for tenant \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588: which open deals have had no activity in the last 30 days, and what are they worth?\r\n\u001b[2m2026-09-23 19:54:28\u001b[0m [\u001b[33m\u001b[1mwarning  \u001b[0m] \u001b[1mmcp.nothing_admissible        \u001b[0m \u001b[36mlabel\u001b[0m=\u001b[35mposthog\u001b[0m \u001b[36mreason\u001b[0m=\u001b[35m'the server was queried and offered no tool Cortex can admit; every tool must declare readOnlyHint: true'\u001b[0m\r\nRead-only: no write capability exists in the tool registry.\r\nCapabilities available to \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588: github, hubspot, posthog, slack\r\n  [  0.1s]          checking what data exists\r\n  [ 12.1s]          found posthog__list_projects\r\n  [ 12.1s]          checking memory for prior context\r\n  [ 24.7s] step 1   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 27.8s] step 1   calling hubspot__pipeline\r\n  [ 29.9s] step 1   got hubspot__pipeline (2 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 29.9s] step 2   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 32.1s] step 2   got read hubspot.pipeline in full (\u2588\u2588 rows) (2 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 32.1s] step 3   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 37.3s] step 3   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 39.1s] step 3   got hubspot__search (3 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 39.1s] step 4   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 43.5s] step 4   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 43.5s] step 4   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 45.5s] step 4   got hubspot__search (4 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 45.5s] step 4   got hubspot__search (5 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 45.5s] step 5   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 52.1s] step 5   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 54.7s] step 5   got hubspot__search (6 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 54.7s] step 6   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 76.5s]          drafting the report from 6 observation(s)\r\n  [ 93.6s]          checking every citation resolves\r\n  [ 93.6s]          re-reading each claim against its own evidence\r\n  sufficiency gate: skipped, this report asserts no cause (0.0s)\r\n  [102.1s]          writing the report\r\n\r\n==============================================================================\r\nQ: Which open deals have had no activity in the last 30 days, and what are they worth?\r\n==============================================================================\r\n\r\nConfidence: low\r\nTook 93s over 6 steps, 39,796 tokens, 6 observations gathered, 5 cited\r\n\r\nANSWER\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  I could not confirm which open deals have had no activity in the last \u2588\u2588 days: the last-modified-date filters I could apply against open-deal status returned zero rows in two attempts, and a broader query without the open-deal filter showed all deals modified before 2026-08-24 were already closed (won or lost), not open.  [hubspot.search a5c28b0d, hubspot.search 9368c46e, hubspot.search 2f4e723f]\r\n  What I can \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 directly is the overall open pipeline: \u2588\u2588 open deals worth $\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588 total, but I have no reliable way from the available queries to split that into an 'inactive \u2588\u2588+ days' subset.  [hubspot.pipeline c33d1e45]\r\n\r\nFINDINGS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  Open pipeline overview  (high)\r\n    - There are \u2588\u2588 open deals in the default pipeline, worth $\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588 in total.  [hubspot.pipeline c33d1e45]\r\n  Activity-based staleness could not be isolated  (low)\r\n    - A search for open deals (hs_is_closed=false) with hs_lastmodifieddate before 2026-08-24 returned zero matching rows.  [hubspot.search a5c28b0d]\r\n    - A follow-up search combining hs_is_closed_won=false and hs_is_closed_lost=false with the same date filter also returned zero rows, so the empty result was not an artifact of the hs_is_closed property alone.  [hubspot.search 9368c46e]\r\n\r\nRISKS AND CAVEATS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  - Two observations (\u2588\u2588\u2588 rows and \u2588\u2588 rows) were \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588ed but only their digests were examined, not the individual deal-level rows; conclusions about which specific stages/deals appear in those result sets rely on digest aggregates rather than row-level inspection.\r\n  - HubSpot's hs_lastmodifieddate field appears to reflect any property update (including closing a deal), not specifically 'activity' such as emails, calls, or meetings; even if the query had returned open deals, that field would be a poor proxy for engagement activity, and no CRM engagement/activity-log query was run.\r\n  - The empty results from both open-deal + date-filter queries could mean either that no open deals are stale (unlikely given \u2588\u2588 open deals span creation dates back to January) or that the filter combination is not supported/behaving as expected by this HubSpot connector; this could not be disambiguated with the tools available.\r\n  - \u2588 claim(s) were removed because an independent check found the cited evidence did not support them. Treat the remaining conclusions with corresponding caution.\r\n  - \u2588 claim(s) go beyond their evidence and are retained with reduced confidence rather than removed, because the rest of each one holds. What the check found:\r\n- executive_summary[0]: The two zero-row queries and the broader query are accurately described, but the claim asserts 'all deals' before 2026-08-24 were closed even though the evidence is truncated (\u2588\u2588\u2588 \r\n\r\nDATA QUALITY\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  - The hs_lastmodifieddate filter, when combined with open-deal filters, returned zero rows in two independent attempts, while returning \u2588\u2588\u2588+ rows when the open-deal filter was dropped -- suggesting last-modified-date on open deals in this dataset may not go stale beyond ~\u2588\u2588 days, or that the filter interaction itself is unsupported for this property combination.\r\n  - The github commits sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github deployments sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github issues sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github links sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The posthog annotations sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The posthog events sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n\r\nSOURCES\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  c33d1e45  hubspot.pipeline  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?open=true\r\n  a5c28b0d  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?hs_is_closed=false&hs_lastmodifieddate[LT]=2026-08-24\r\n  2f4e723f  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?hs_lastmodifieddate[LT]=2026-08-24\r\n  187d2256  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?hs_is_closed=false&hs_lastmodifieddate?\r\n  9368c46e  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?hs_is_closed_lost=false&hs_is_closed_won=false&hs_lastmodifieddate[LT]=2026-08-24\r\n\r\nphase breakdown (102s wall, 99s measured)\r\n  phase        calls  seconds  share    mean  tokens\r\n  survey           1     12.1   12%    12.1  in 0 out 0\r\n  recall           1     12.6   12%    12.6  in 0 out 0\r\n  loop_model       6     43.2   42%     7.2  in 